url: "https://github.com/linus10x/cre-agent-audit"
abstract: >-
  Reference governance patterns, schemas, and runnable implementations
  for audit-ready AI agents in commercial real estate operations.
  Covers autonomy-level classification (Autonomy Ladder™ A0 through A4),
  the Fair-Housing Pre-Flight Gate, Lease-Abstraction Provenance, Tenant
  PII Data Residency Partitioning, hash-chained audit ledger, sovereign
  veto with structured bypass, DEFCON state machine, shadow-mode rollout,
  and a regulation-mapping loader. MIT-licensed, zero runtime
  dependencies, primary-source regulatory citations. Companion to
  finserv-agent-audit for financial services. The repository is a
  reference architecture, not legal, regulatory, audit, or fairness-testing
  advice — see DISCLAIMER.md.
